# A turnstile with an attendant override: the first matching transition is taken
law turnstile_override
kind machine
claim a coin unlocks a locked turnstile; a push locks it again
claim an attendant's push on a locked turnstile lets the person through and leaves it unlocked; the transition listed first is the one taken
claim the light is green exactly when the turnstile is unlocked and not in maintenance
source the textbook turnstile machine with an override (the rule is stated here; nothing outside this file defines it)

const maintenance bool = false
state locked initial
state unlocked
event coin
event push guard attendant

on coin from locked to unlocked
on push from locked to unlocked when attendant
on push from locked unlocked to locked

allow green when state == unlocked and not maintenance

verdict the new state, whether the transition was taken, and the light after the step, for every state, event and guard
